        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana FRP25, Solid Brass Flush Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFlush Ring Pulls are especially designed for cabinets or doors when you want a flush (non protruding) handle pull. The Large Flush Ring Pull's solid brass construction is durable, allowing for years of continuous use and is resistant to corrosion. It measures 2-1/2\" high and 1-7/8\" wide. Comes packaged with matching finish screws for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-FRP25-Specifications.gif?v=1704354644\" width=\"326\" height=\"219\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana FRP25 Ring Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/small-flush-ring-pull-deltana-frp175\"><b>Small Flush Ring Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana FRP25 Large Flush Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Max Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Max Depth: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FRP25.pdf?v=1704262161\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana FRP25  Dimensions  Diagram (PDF)</a></b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Flush Ring Pull | Deltana FRP25",
                "description": "Solid Brass Flush Ring Pull Deltana FRP25 - Flush Ring Pulls are especially designed for cabinets or doors when you want a flush (non protruding) handle pull. The Large Flush Ring Pull's solid brass construction is durable, allowing for years of continuous use and is resistant to corrosion. It measures 2-1/2 inches high and 1-7/8 inches wide. Comes packaged with matching finish screws for easy installation. Available in 9 great finishes.",
                "keywords": "FRP25U3, del-FRP25 Large Flush Ring Pulls, deltana FRP25 Solid Brass large flush ring pulls, deltana solid brass door flush pulls, pocket doors, handle for sliding doors, pocket door handles, cabinet pulls, square ring pulls, deltana pocket door hardware, DEL-FRP25U10B, DEL-FRP25U15, DEL-FRP25U15A, DEL-FRP25U19, DEL-FRP25U26, DEL-FRP25U26D, DEL-FRP25U5, DEL-FRP25U3, DEL-FRP25CR003,"
